OL,5,G0300 1Xtra Salutes... Mighty Sparrow
OL,6,     F1Xtra Salutes the Caribbean
OL,7,     Fshowcasing the master of Calypso
OL,8,     Fand Soca, Sparrow. With a career
OL,9,     Fspanning over 50 years, Sparrow's
OL,10,     Fclever lyrical wordplay shows why
OL,11,     Fhe is the boss!
OL,12,G0400 David Rodigan
OL,13,     FSheldon Shepherd and Storm Saulter
OL,14,     Fpop by the studio to chat about
OL,15,     Fthe new TV series, Possession.
OL,16,     FSheldon has to be quick though...
OL,17,     Fhe's got to make it back in time
OL,18,     Ffor Carnival.
